          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Fixed: the panic never happened. 1.0 needed a kernel write function Dopamine doesn't provide.\n- Now uses the kernel's own debug panic (reboot with RB_PANIC). Nothing is written to kernel memory.\n- Fixed: the Trigger Kernel Panic button in Settings now works.\n- Confirmation is a system alert from SpringBoard, so other apps can't trigger a panic on their own.",
          "useSpacing": true
